# Cloudflare Workers static assets.
#
# Deliberately almost empty. Cloudflare's default html_handling already serves
# /sources from sources.html and / from index.html, so aliasing those here would
# fight it and loop. Targets are extensionless for the same reason: pointing at
# .html would cost a second hop as Cloudflare redirected it back.
/privacy       /about#privacy      301
/disclaimer    /about#disclaimer   301
/method        /about              301
